sequenceDiagram
  %% Container runtime status, docs/reference/development-containers.md#processes.
  %% status: draft
  %% command: none · Process lists
  autonumber
  participant A as Node observer
  participant C as Instance container
  participant R as Reverb
  participant GW as Gateway
  A->>GW: Fetch watch list
  GW-->>A: Container names and Process units
  loop every 10 seconds, or watch list changed
    A->>C: Read listed units<br/>incus exec · systemctl show
    C-->>A: ActiveState per unit
    A->>R: Existing Process snapshots and updates
    R->>GW: Agent observations
  end
  Note over GW: Lists read reported container state<br/>unknown when absent, failed or stale
